      {
        "description": "ch0328_cafe_monolog_1",
        "category": "cafe",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "様式美こそ、大切にするものだね。",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_cafe_monolog_1.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_cafe_monolog_2",
        "category": "cafe",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "素晴らしい！これほどの蔵書があるとは……。",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_cafe_monolog_2.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_cafe_monolog_3",
        "category": "cafe",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "何やら視線を感じたような……気のせいか。",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_cafe_monolog_3.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_cafe_monolog_4",
        "category": "cafe",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "温泉の装飾に……は難しいな。",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_cafe_monolog_4.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_cafe_monolog_5",
        "category": "cafe",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "ふむ、このデザイン……参考になるな。",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_cafe_monolog_5.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_cardgame_act_1",
        "category": "event",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "イオリちゃん！イオリちゃんじゃないか！",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_cardgame_act_1.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_cardgame_act_2",
        "category": "event",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "ハーハッハッハッハ！またあえて嬉しいよ",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_cardgame_act_2.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_cardgame_act_3",
        "category": "event",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "これはこれは、正義実現委員会の副委員長様。イチカちゃんからお噂はかねがね…",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_cardgame_act_3.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_cardgame_act_4",
        "category": "event",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "ひ、ひ、ひえええぇっ！！！",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_cardgame_act_4.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_commonskill",
        "category": "battle",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "プレゼ～ント！",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_commonskill.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_eventlobby_1_1",
        "category": "event",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "プライベートビーチ、か。ブルジョワの極みだな。",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_eventlobby_1_1.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_eventlobby_1_2",
        "category": "event",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "我々のように理念を持つのはいかがかな？",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_eventlobby_1_2.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_eventlobby_2_1",
        "category": "event",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "トリニティに数多存在する「潜在的な温泉」――それが未だ埋もれたままでいる。",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_eventlobby_2_1.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_eventlobby_2_2",
        "category": "event",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "だから、我々が来たのさ。",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_eventlobby_2_2.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_eventlobby_3_1",
        "category": "event",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "ふむ……あれがティーパーティー、か。",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_eventlobby_3_1.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_eventlobby_3_2",
        "category": "event",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "いいのかね？こうも簡単に接触できて……彼らのSPはどうしたんだ？",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_eventlobby_3_2.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_eventlobby_3_3",
        "category": "event",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "そんな目で見ないでくれ、先生。別に何もしてやいないさ。",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_eventlobby_3_3.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_eventlobby_4",
        "category": "event",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "ん？なんだ、先生！くすぐったいじゃあないか！っはは！やめたまえよ！",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_eventlobby_4.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_eventlogin_1_1",
        "category": "event",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "青い空、広い海！うむ！美しいビーチだ！",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_eventlogin_1_1.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_eventlogin_1_2",
        "category": "event",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "ここなら海を一望できる温泉が作れるな！",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_eventlogin_1_2.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_eventlogin_2_1",
        "category": "event",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "おお、先生？先生じゃあないか！",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_eventlogin_2_1.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_eventlogin_2_2",
        "category": "event",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "残念ながら温泉はまだできてないぞ？",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_eventlogin_2_2.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_eventlogin_season_1_1",
        "category": "event",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "痛いなぁ……まったく、イチカちゃんも少しは手加減してほしいものだ。",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_eventlogin_season_1_1.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_eventlogin_season_1_2",
        "category": "event",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "私たちの仲だっていうのに……先生もそう思うだろう？",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_eventlogin_season_1_2.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_eventlogin_season_2_1",
        "category": "event",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "――火種が一つ。",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_eventlogin_season_2_1.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_eventlogin_season_2_2",
        "category": "event",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "連鎖反応とは、ほんの小さな火種から始まるものさ。",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_eventlogin_season_2_2.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_eventlogin_season_2_3",
        "category": "event",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "では――火種を一つ、落としたら。どうなるのか……気になるだろう？",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_eventlogin_season_2_3.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_eventlogin_season_end_1",
        "category": "event",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "いやぁ～これは一杯食わされたな！ハーハッハッハッハ！",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_eventlogin_season_end_1.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_eventlogin_season_end_2",
        "category": "event",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "ん？機嫌が良さそうに見える？",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_eventlogin_season_end_2.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_eventlogin_season_end_3",
        "category": "event",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "……そう、見えるんだな？",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_eventlogin_season_end_3.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_exskill_1",
        "category": "battle",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "愉快！痛快！ハーッハッハッハッ！",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_exskill_1.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_exskill_2",
        "category": "battle",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "まるで暴れ牛だな！オ、レ！オ、レ！",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_exskill_2.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_exskill_3",
        "category": "battle",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "おっと、制御ボタンをつけ忘れてしまったな！ハーッハッハッ！",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_exskill_3.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_exskill_level_1",
        "category": "battle",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "いたた……ハーッハッハッ！",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_exskill_level_1.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_exskill_level_2",
        "category": "battle",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "ぐはっ……！面白いじゃないか！",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_exskill_level_2.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_exskill_level_3",
        "category": "battle",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "がはっ……！まあ、こんな時もあるだろう！",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_exskill_level_3.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_exweapon_get",
        "category": "growup",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "リスクは覚悟の上で共にいる、と考えても良いのだな？それなら重畳――地獄行きの片道切符に、最後まで付き合ってもらおうじゃあないか。ハーハッハッハッハ！",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_exweapon_get.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_formation_in_1",
        "category": "formation",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "まだもう１件掘れそうだな！次へ行くぞ！",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_formation_in_1.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_formation_in_2",
        "category": "formation",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "土木？爆破？それとも……？",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_formation_in_2.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_formation_select",
        "category": "formation",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "ああ！溺れた時もこうしてくれると助かる！",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_formation_select.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_gachaget",
        "category": "growup",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "……聞こえるかな、火薬が炸裂する音が。火がついた爆弾を止めることはできない――それこそがロマンというものだ。",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_gachaget.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_growup_1",
        "category": "growup",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "おや、いいのかな？私にこんなことをして――ひと夏の火傷ではすまないぞ？",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_growup_1.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_growup_2",
        "category": "growup",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "もらえるものはありがたくいただく主義だが……先生に借りができてしまったな。",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_growup_2.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_growup_3",
        "category": "growup",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "ここで学んだことを別の場所で活かしても――恨まないでくれよ？",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_growup_3.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_growup_4",
        "category": "growup",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "これが夏の思い出、というやつかな？胸の奥がスカッとしたよ。ありがとう、先生。",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_growup_4.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_lobby_1_1",
        "category": "lobby",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "シャーレ当番は最高だ！追いかけてくる連中がいないからな！",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_lobby_1_1.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_lobby_1_2",
        "category": "lobby",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "まぁ、しかし……道中が不安だがね。",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_lobby_1_2.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_lobby_2_1",
        "category": "lobby",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "シャーレは良い立地をしている……しかし……",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_lobby_2_1.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_lobby_2_2",
        "category": "lobby",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "温泉がないのだけが残念だ……おや、そんな目をしないでくれよ。",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_lobby_2_2.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_lobby_3_1",
        "category": "lobby",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "少しずつ燃えていく芯……あれを眺めていると、血が騒ぐんだ。",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_lobby_3_1.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_lobby_3_2",
        "category": "lobby",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "……花火の話だとも。ハーハッハッハッハ！",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_lobby_3_2.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_lobby_4_1",
        "category": "lobby",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "ん？水着を着ているからって泳ぐわけないだろう。",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_lobby_4_1.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_lobby_4_2",
        "category": "lobby",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "……湯船で泳ぐのはマナー違反だからな。披露できなくて残念だ。",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_lobby_4_2.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_lobby_5_1",
        "category": "lobby",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "読書？ああ、暇つぶしの一環だ。まあ、趣味と言えないこともないがね。",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_lobby_5_1.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_lobby_5_2",
        "category": "lobby",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "時は金なり、というだろう？時間は有限だからな。遊んでいてはもったいない。",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_lobby_5_2.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_login_1_1",
        "category": "lobby",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "おや先生。先に失礼していたよ。",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_login_1_1.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_login_1_2",
        "category": "lobby",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "ちょっと追われていてね……しばし匿ってはくれないだろうか？",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_login_1_2.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_login_2_1",
        "category": "lobby",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "まさかこんな時に当番とは……いやはや。",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_login_2_1.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_login_2_2",
        "category": "lobby",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "まぁ、構わないさ。ここにいる限りは追われることはないだろうからな。ハーハッハッハッ！",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_login_2_2.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_memoriallobby_1_1",
        "category": "lobby",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "知っているだろう？この辺りは治安が悪いんだ。",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_memoriallobby_1_1.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_memoriallobby_1_2",
        "category": "lobby",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "ひと一人消えた程度じゃ、誰も気づかない。",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_memoriallobby_1_2.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_memoriallobby_2",
        "category": "lobby",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "詰めが甘いよ、先生。一を識って、二を知らず、だ。",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_memoriallobby_2.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_memoriallobby_3",
        "category": "lobby",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "先生が私を助けようとすればするほど…私にとって、良い手駒となる。…",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_memoriallobby_3.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_memoriallobby_4",
        "category": "lobby",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "そして――そういうものであればあるほど、手に入れたくなるというのが人の性だ。",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_memoriallobby_4.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_memoriallobby_5_1",
        "category": "lobby",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "私の本性が知りたいと言っていただろう……？感想はいかがかな？",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_memoriallobby_5_1.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_memoriallobby_5_2",
        "category": "lobby",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "引き返したいと言っても――もう遅いがね。",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_memoriallobby_5_2.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_memoriallobby_6_1",
        "category": "lobby",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "……サプラーイズ！",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_memoriallobby_6_1.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_memoriallobby_6_2",
        "category": "lobby",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "それっぽかっただろう？そう怖い顔をしないでくれ。冗談だよ。",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_memoriallobby_6_2.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_relationship_up_1",
        "category": "growup",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "おや、これは大変なことになってしまったな。先生のことが気になって仕方がない。面白い変化だ。",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_relationship_up_1.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_relationship_up_2",
        "category": "growup",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "随分変わった趣味をしているじゃあないか。まあ私にとっては良いことだがな！ハーッハッハッ！",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_relationship_up_2.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_relationship_up_3",
        "category": "growup",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "おや、自分が今何をしているのか――理解しているのかな？",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_relationship_up_3.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_relationship_up_4",
        "category": "growup",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "……私はちゃんと借りを返す性分でね。はてさて、どうしたものか。",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_relationship_up_4.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_season_birthday",
        "category": "lobby",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "ああ、今日は私の誕生日だとも！祝ってもらいに来たぞ！いやぁ～なかなか誕生日だというのに落ち着かなくてな！",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_season_birthday.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_season_birthday_player",
        "category": "lobby",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "うむ！実にめでたい日だ！遠慮することはない、先生。パーティーをはじめようじゃあないか！",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_season_birthday_player.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_season_halloween_1",
        "category": "lobby",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "ふんふふんふん～今日は愉快な日だな先生！うむ！",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_season_halloween_1.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_season_halloween_2",
        "category": "lobby",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "ああ……そういう日に、するのだがな。",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_season_halloween_2.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_season_newyear_1",
        "category": "lobby",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "あけましておめでとう、先生！",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_season_newyear_1.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_season_newyear_2",
        "category": "lobby",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "なんだ急に。時節の挨拶は大切だろう？こっちの界隈では特にな。",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_season_newyear_2.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_season_xmas_1",
        "category": "lobby",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "クリスマスの時期は寒いからな！温まるものが必要だろう！我ら温泉開発部の出番、というわけだ！",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_season_xmas_1.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "ch0328_season_xmas_2",
        "category": "lobby",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "そんな顔をするな、先生。我々ほどキヴォトスに貢献している部活は他にないのだぞ？",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0328_season_xmas_2.ogg"
      },
      {
        "description": "CH0328_Title",
        "category": "lobby",
        "text": "",
        "text_original": "うむっ！ブルーアカイブッ！",
        "file": "https://static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%92%E5%B7%9D%20%E9%9C%9E/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/CH0328_Title.ogg"
      }
    ],
